---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Jonas Lin">
  <section class="split-page shell">
    <div><p class="eyebrow">About / Profile</p><h1>Jonas Lin</h1><p class="about-hero-summary">I am an interactive media designer working across games, immersive experiences, 3D design, cinematic visuals, and UI/UX.</p></div>
    <img class="portrait-image" src="/media/portrait.webp" alt="Portrait of Jonas Lin" width="1279" height="1362" decoding="async" />
  </section>
  <section class="about-copy shell" data-reveal><div><p>My background spans media production, visual design, and interactive technology. I studied Media Production and Design at Carleton University and am currently pursuing an M.S. in Integrated Design and Media at New York University.</p><p>Working across game design, VR, 3D environments, web design, UI/UX, and digital media has drawn me toward projects where visual storytelling and interaction shape the experience together. I enjoy moving between concept, design, and implementation, using tools such as Unity, Unreal Engine, Blender, Figma, and Adobe Creative Cloud to turn ideas into playable or interactive work.</p><p>My projects range from cooperative games and VR experiences to virtual exhibitions and cinematic visualization, but they share a focus on creating clear, immersive, and visually considered experiences.</p><a href="/resume">View my résumé ↗</a></div></section>
  <section class="profile-details shell">
    <section class="profile-section" data-reveal>
      <p class="eyebrow">01 / Education</p>
      <div class="profile-entries">
        <article><span>September 2025 — Present</span><h2>Master of Science in Integrated Design and Media</h2><p>New York University</p></article>
        <article><span>September 2020 — June 2025</span><h2>Bachelor of Media Production and Design</h2><p>Carleton University</p></article>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="profile-section" data-reveal>
      <p class="eyebrow">02 / Experience</p>
      <div class="profile-entries experience-entries">
        <article><span>October 2024 — April 2025</span><h2>Research Assistant</h2><p>Carleton University</p><ul><li>Co-created an interactive 3D digital exhibition.</li><li>Produced a prototype for the exhibition experience.</li></ul></article>
        <article><span>September 2023 — December 2023</span><h2>Web Communications Advisor</h2><p>Carleton University</p><ul><li>Developed training content across video, images, and text.</li><li>Built and configured website content.</li></ul></article>
        <article><span>June 2023 — August 2023</span><h2>UI/UX Designer</h2><p>IES Lab</p><ul><li>Developed training content across video, images, and text.</li><li>Designed instructional and promotional materials.</li><li>Built 3D models for a smart factory project.</li></ul></article>
        <article><span>January 2023 — May 2023</span><h2>Electronic Media Assistant</h2><p>Carleton University</p><ul><li>Created graphics and video content for digital media needs.</li><li>Designed instructional and promotional materials.</li><li>Redesigned website content and improved the user experience.</li></ul></article>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="profile-section" data-reveal>
      <p class="eyebrow">03 / Capabilities</p>
      <ul class="profile-list"><li>Interactive media design</li><li>Game and level design</li><li>VR interaction</li><li>3D design and animation</li><li>UI/UX</li><li>Web design</li><li>Graphic design</li><li>Video editing</li></ul>
    </section>
    <section class="profile-section" data-reveal>
      <p class="eyebrow">04 / Tools</p>
      <ul class="profile-list tool-list"><li>Unity</li><li>Unreal Engine 5</li><li>C#</li><li>Blender</li><li>3ds Max</li><li>ZBrush</li><li>Marmoset Toolbag</li><li>Substance Painter</li><li>Figma</li><li>Adobe XD</li><li>WordPress</li><li>Framer</li><li>Spline</li><li>Adobe Creative Cloud</li></ul>
    </section>
  </section>
</Layout>
